    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu nende omukunda kwaNabotsi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olunyuma lwamakhuwa ako, Nabotsi omuYezereeli yali nali nomukunda kwemitsabibu, okwali nikuli muYezereeli, ahambi neitookho yaAhabu omuruchi waSamaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu namusunjila Nabotsi ari Umbeesie omukundakwo kwemitsabibu, engukhole eshilundu shieliani, shichila kuli ahambi neinzu yanje; nekhuheelesie omukunda kundi kwemitsabibu omulayi muno mushilenje shiakwo; nohomba, noba niwenya, nekhuheelesie amapeesa kobukusi bwakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Nabotsi namukalusia Ahabu ari Shilinyalikha ta, mbu ekhuheelesie obulaame bwabakuuka banje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Ahabu niyeenjila munzuye narunyile, nasinyiishe, khulwa likhuwa elia Nabotsi omuYezereeli yali namusunjiile; okhuba yasunga mbu Shindalakhuheelesia obulaame bwabakuuka banje ta. Kho nakona khushitali, nafutaarila abandu, naloba ebiliibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yezebeli omukhasiwe namwitsila, namureeba mbu Omwoyokwo kuli neshibeela mbushiina, noralia eshindu ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namukalusia mbu Shichila esungaane nende Nabotsi, omuYezereeli, nimuboolela mbu Ungusie omukundakwo kwemitsabibu amapeesa; kata noba niwenya nekhuheelesie omukunda kundi kwemitsabibu mushilenje shiakwo; naye niyangalusia mbu Shindalakhuheelesia omukunda kwanje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yezebeli omukhasiwe namusunjila mbu Shioli niwe ourukanga Isiraeli? Buukha, oliekhwo ebiliibwa, omwoyokwo kutsatsahale; isie nekhuhe omukunda kwemitsabibu kwaNabotsi omuYezereeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yahandiika tsibarwa muliira liaAhabu, natsiikala narakhwo eshibalikhoshie, narumila abakofu nabakhulundu abamenyanga nende Nabotsi mwitaala liabwe tsibarwa tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mubarwa tsana, yahandiika ari Khupe omulome kweinyanga yokhuhonga inzala, nimwikhasia Nabotsi hekulu imbeli wabandu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana mure abandu babili abamayaanu abeshifwabwi imbeliwe, barumbule akobuloli okhumufukula, bari Wanyeka Nyasaye nende omuruchi. Mana mumuyile elwanyi, mumulase namachina afwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abandu belitaala liabwe, abakofu nabakhulundu abamenyanga mwitaala liabwe, nibakhola shinga Yezebeli olwa yali nabalachile, shinga olwa yali nahandiichile mubarwatsie etsia yali nabahandiichiile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhupa omulome kweinyanga yokhuhonga inzala, nibeekhasia Nabotsi hekulu imbeli wabandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabandu babili tsana abamayaanu abeshifwabwi nibeenjila nibeekhala imbeliwe; abandu abo abamayaanu abeshifwabwi nibarumbula akobuloli okhumufukula Nabotsi, imbeli wabandu, bari Nabotsi yanyeka Nyasaye nende omuruchi. Mana nibamuyila nibamurusia mwitaala nibamulasa namachina, nafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nibakhupila Yezebeli omunwa, mbu Nabotsi alasilwe namachina; ufwile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa Yezebeli yahulila ulasilwe namachina, ufwile, Yezebeli namusunjila Ahabu ari Rula, obukule omukunda kwemitsabibu kwaNabotsi omuYezereeli, okwa yaloba okhukhukusia amapeesa; okhuba Nabotsi shiashili mwoyo ta; afwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa Ahabu yahulila mbu Nabotsi ufwile, Ahabu yarula nakholomokha okhutsia enamukunda kwaNabotsi omuYezereeli, okhukubukula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana likhuwa liOMWAMI niliitsila Eliya omuTishibe, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rula, okholomoshe otsie okhwakaanila Ahabu, omuruchi waIsiraeli, oumenyanga eSamaria; lola, ali mumukunda kwemitsabibu kwaNabotsi, ewa akholomooshe natsia okhukubukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe omuboolele ori Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Khane omwirile nende okhubibukula pe? Mana omusunjile mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Habundu tsana aha tsimbwa tsikhombeele amatsayi ka-Nabotsi, niho aha tsimbwa tsilakhombela amatsayi koko nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu nasunjila Eliya ari Khane unyoolile, iwe omusuku wanje? Naye nakalusia mbu Ekhunyoolile; shichila weekusia omwene okhukhola akali amabii mumoni tsiOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ndalakhukhupia khushibii, nikhumalilana, nikhalaka khuAhabu buli mundu yesi oweshisaatsa, kata omubohe kata omulekhuule muIsiraeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndalakhola inzuyo yifwane shinga inzu yaYeroboamu waNebati, khandi shinga inzu yaBaasha waAhiya, khulwa obusinyisii obwa wasinyisia, nochila Isiraeli niyonoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi khuYezebeli yesi OMWAMI yaboola, ari Tsimbwa tsilaliila Yezebeli halukoba lwaYezereeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi waAhabu oufwila mwitaala tsimbwa tsilamulia; ne oyo oufwila ebulafu, amanyonyi akokhwikulu kalamulia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yabulaho oweekusia okhukhola akali amabii mumoni tsiOMWAMI shinga Ahabu, owa Yezebeli omukhasiwe yatsuuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakholanga akebisinyo muno, nalonda khumindu echio echiinamilungwa, shinga abaAmori olwa bakholanga, aba OMWAMI yarusia imbeli wabaana baIsiraeli.",
