        {
          "text": "Oluutsi shinga Ahabu olwa yoongolanga imbeli wanje? Kho olwa yoongolanga ario imbeli wanje, shindalaleera amabii tsana mundaalo tsitsie ta; habula mundaalo tsiomwanawe ndalakhupia inzuye khushibii.",
